Ouverte 2.0","references":[{"title":"File:Petit Palais Paris 2.jpg","author":"Chabe01","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Petit_Palais_Paris_2.jpg","sourceSha1":"93e8fc3ea5d976ac68ae39e1c0cd515fe63b92ec","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"Front facade and dome"},{"title":"File:Dome @ Garden @ Petit Palais @ Paris (34892554575).jpg","author":"Guilhem Vellut from Paris, France","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Dome_@_Garden_@_Petit_Palais_@_Paris_(34892554575).jpg","sourceSha1":"44b2319cd0bdadd79fdc3251665850913c380a8a","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"Central dome from the interior garden"},{"title":"File:Entrance @ Petit Palais @ Near Champs Elysée @ Paris (30738052615).jpg","author":"Guilhem Vellut from Paris, France","license":"CC BY 2.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Entrance_@_Petit_Palais_@_Near_Champs_Elys%C3%A9e_@_Paris_(30738052615).jpg","sourceSha1":"5837e4c737426f12bbe82059b82d06446e775097","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"Main entrance close-up"},{"title":"File:Exterior of Petit Palais (21).jpg","author":"bynyalcin","license":"CC BY 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Exterior_of_Petit_Palais_(21).jpg","sourceSha1":"a3b760b142fc8641df5b2c788317e663fdac25df","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"Complete main facade"},{"title":"File:Cour intérieur et jardin du Petit-Palais 04.jpg","author":"Sigoise","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cour_int%C3%A9rieur_et_jardin_du_Petit-Palais_04.jpg","sourceSha1":"0c96bbbee82683cdd70dcf7a4a28ebd316012d06","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"Outdoor garden and curved peristyle"},{"title":"File:Grand Palais Petit Palais Elysee P1180998.jpg","author":"David.Monniaux","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","sourcePage":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Grand_Palais_Petit_Palais_Elysee_P1180998.jpg","sourceSha1":"30603672e966914825ea3bcd1e8fd3d5b2f592f7","use":"visual-reference-only","view":"Oblique aerial showing courtyard void and roof hierarchy"}],"aliases":[],"authors":["Open Landmarks contributors"],"artisticLicense":"CC-BY-4.0","spatialDataLicense":"ODbL-1.0","licenseScope":"CC BY applies to original artistic contributions only; ODbL applies to OSM-derived spatial data. Reference photographs retain their own licenses. Dimension evidence from IGN LiDAR HD retains Licence Ouverte 2.0.","assistance":"AI-assisted architectural interpretation and procedural recipe authoring; deterministic Python/Blender export. No photographic textures.","review":{"status":"pending","reviewer":null,"checks":{}},"modelingNotes":["OSM relation/2778854 supplies the unchanged outer footprint and D-shaped open garden. It has no building parts or height. All architectural zones below are inferred within that plan, not invented OSM parts.","IGN LiDAR HD, acquired 2023-03-03, Licence Ouverte 2.0, supplies 90,210 classified building returns inside the footprint. Ground datum is 32.931923 m IGN69. The coherent central finial maximum 41.958077 m is rounded to 42 m. Source manifest, tile URL, crop hashes, measured zone profiles and interpretation are in bundles/petit-palais/dimensions.json; no point-cloud surface is distributed.","The measured local architectural frame has origin (-26.93,2.33) at the central finial, depth axis (0.997245,-0.07418), north facade axis (0.07418,0.997245). Gallery ridges are about 23.2 m front and 23.5 m rear, curved garden peristyle terrace 13.4-14 m, principal corner roof peaks about 28.4-29 m with ornament below 33 m. Roof planes, eaves and pavilion outlines are inferred from these returns and reviewed photographs.","Selected Commons Chabe01 Petit Palais Paris2.jpg gives the west colonnade, paired monumental Corinthian columns, giant portal arch, slate dome and corner pavilion silhouettes. Guilhem Vellut Entrance @ Petit Palais and Dome @ Garden give the stepped archivolts, circular dome oculi, ribs and open lantern. Sigoise Cour intérieur et jardin du Petit-Palais 04.jpg gives the open paired granite garden columns, flat entablature, lower balustraded terrace and higher pilastered gallery walls. David.Monniaux oblique aerial gives coarse evidence for the open court and pitched perimeter roofs, not measurements.","The museum official history https://www.petitpalais.paris.fr/explorer/le-petit-palais/lhistoire-du-petit-palais explicitly identifies four oculi at the entrance rotunda roof base. Four cardinal primary hoods are retained in both LODs.","Central drum radius about 10 m and authored dome profile follow radial IGN quantiles: 23.3 m at radius 10, 28.3 at radius 8, 30.6 at radius 6, 32.1 at radius 4, 33.5 at radius 2.5. Narrow open lantern, cupola and 42 m finial remain in the measured central high cluster.","Window/door/oculus panels are attached to real walls and hoods. Front portico and curved paired-column garden peristyle are genuine air spaces below their stone roofs. Sculpture, Corinthian capital bells, urns and gold grille are original abstract geometry; no inscriptions, heraldry or individual carvings are copied. Both authored LODs preserve court, open colonnades, portal and roof hierarchy. Low repeats fewer garden column pairs and shifts the shafts roughly 1 m within the peristyle band, keeping air between the central pair while floor and roof are clipped to the original mapped garden niches."],"source":{"url":"/objects/c26fc0ca846c4f9726fba213d409c38f7f3484b7bc30e3c83c84f957fb3095f5/source.blend.gz","bytes":668162,"sha256":"c26fc0ca846c4f9726fba213d409c38f7f3484b7bc30e3c83c84f957fb3095f5"},"spatialSource":{"url":"/objects/289138663f12ae91bc260b5771672bc4a89901b605097a8f1c1e1ddd0d47fc86/spatial-source.json","bytes":21897,"sha256":"289138663f12ae91bc260b5771672bc4a89901b605097a8f1c1e1ddd0d47fc86"},"preview":{"url":"/objects/a74f3448f6f43debc490696ae7b06978cfb3698721124dcf8998a8dd48e29e14/preview.webp","bytes":13608,"sha256":"a74f3448f6f43debc490696ae7b06978cfb3698721124dcf8998a8dd48e29e14"},"previewDirection":[-1.8,0.8,1],"revision":"98a71360e183373226fdc23380de67f5542a276b3753c3741816bfcc98bb61e3","publicationRevision":"4b7061a04fa008c70c441b3715f6d65ca9ba5c5655091e73457f08c592ee2f6b","bounds":[2.3143339,48.8654594,2.3156049,48.866628],"approved":false,"materialLibrary":{"schemaVersion":1,"sha256":"f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647","url":"/materials/f1d437b52bbae89b4d9ee6420ea21fefbf88b8682a9254cd0b052421b0c99647.json"},"metadata":"/assets/petit-palais/4b7061a04fa008c70c441b3715f6d65ca9ba5c5655091e73457f08c592ee2f6b/asset.json","validation":"/assets/petit-palais/4b7061a04fa008c70c441b3715f6d65ca9ba5c5655091e73457f08c592ee2f6b/validation.json"}